    "basis_of_bearings": "the plat bears the west line of the NW quarter S 00 07 26 W; the BLM section-29 west line (NW corner to SW corner vertex -99.045854, 40.713931) has azimuth 180.3362 deg in a local transverse Mercator at the corner, so the plat traverse is rotated by +0.2123 deg",
